{"id":"n80826-1-9","stage":5,"title":"판정 · 判定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80826-1-9-1","ko":"저희 아버지께서 건강이 심각한 상태라는 판정을 받으셨어요.","zh":"我们父亲被诊断出健康状况非常严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지께서","audio":"/audio/e826a68a64d3d7144cf6.mp3"}},{"text":"건강이","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강이","audio":"/audio/533ba04e9890ae84a01b.mp3"}},{"text":"심각한","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심각하다：严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심각하다","audio":"/audio/725518675d1ea82394eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64966","senseId":"1","lemma":"심각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심각한","audio":"/audio/30f02087d3c964ac8b60.mp3"}},{"text":"상태라는","meaning":"状态","explanation":"상태：状态；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"상태","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16489","senseId":"1","lemma":"상태","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상태라는","audio":"/audio/3345fc632f67d42dc481.mp3"}},{"text":"판정을","meaning":"判定，裁定","explanation":"판정：判定，裁定；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"판정","audio":"/audio/fb77d92a3c6bcd697fba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80826","senseId":"1","lemma":"판정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"판정을","audio":"/audio/efa4c6db3eb694647331.mp3"}},{"text":"받으셨어요.","meaning":"接受，收到","explanation":"받다：接受，收到；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"10","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으셨어요","audio":"/audio/b84dafc2f752dae8b47e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"725518675d1ea823","term":"심각하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/725518675d1ea82394eb.mp3","entryId":"64966","definition":"状态或程度非常深刻、迫切或重大。","pronunciation":["심ː가카다"]},{"id":"e10195a1239fb321","term":"상태","zh":"状态","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3","entryId":"16489","definition":"事物或现象的模样或情况。","pronunciation":["상태"]},{"id":"fb77d92a3c6bcd69","term":"판정","zh":"判定，裁定","audio":"/audio/fb77d92a3c6bcd697fba.mp3","entryId":"80826","definition":"分辨对错或好坏而决定。","pronunciation":["판정"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，收到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"遭受某种决定或判决。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1144205d1321ecff02b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80826-1-9-2","ko":"걱정이 많이 되시겠어요. 얼른 나으시길 바라요.","zh":"您一定很担心吧，希望他能尽快康复。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걱정이","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이","audio":"/audio/31c9db58edf96a514e66.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"되시겠어요.","meaning":"感到","explanation":"되다：感到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"7","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되시겠어요","audio":"/audio/2c252b74be8e23223dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"나으시길","meaning":"痊愈","explanation":"낫다：痊愈；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62354","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나으시길","audio":"/audio/476dd45e953b844e6084.mp3"}},{"text":"바라요.","meaning":"期待，盼望","explanation":"바라다：期待，盼望；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"바라다","audio":"/audio/527140f180313dac73f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58156","senseId":"1","lemma":"바라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바라요","audio":"/audio/4bededc82ad120b04491.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"感到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"处于某种心理状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"痊愈","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"62354","definition":"疾病或伤口等消失而恢复原样。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]},{"id":"527140f180313dac","term":"바라다","zh":"期待，盼望","audio":"/audio/527140f180313dac73f4.mp3","entryId":"58156","definition":"希望事情按照某种想法或愿望得以实现。","pronunciation":["바라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3a14d4b73a5cff1eff0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.322,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80826","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您一定很担心吧，希望他能尽快康复。","外面已经黑透了呢。","我们父亲被诊断出健康状况非常严重。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您一定很担心吧，希望他能尽快康复。","我们父亲被诊断出健康状况非常严重。","外面已经黑透了呢。"],"answer":0}]}
